// PortalStaticOverlay (portalstaticoverlay_ps20b / portalstaticoverlay_vs20):
// the static texture (or gray) blended with $staticamount as alpha, never above
// the alpha mask's alpha (alpha tested GREATER 0), on a brush with a
// translated MODEL matrix (the brush position ignores the translation).
